@* The "Problem folder:" caption and what follows it — the one place the app
   spells the caption (halheinrich/backgammon#199). Each host decides what the
   caption frames, from PickedProblemFolder; this component decides how the
   caption reads. Renders nothing when there is no folder to name (see the
   code-behind). *@
@if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(Description))
{
    <span class="problem-folder-label">Problem folder: @Description</span>
}
